type: software
title: "linear-algebra-playground"
abstract: >-
  An open educational repository for learning linear algebra. It follows the
  progression of MIT 18.06 and pairs plain-language explanations, visual
  notebooks, and exercises with from-scratch Python implementations that are
  verified against NumPy.
